  "question": {
    "text": "In an experiment to determine the resistance of a galvanometer by half deflection method, the circuit shown is used. In one set of readings, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mtext>&nbsp;Ω</mtext></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>&nbsp;Ω</mtext></math>, then the resistance of the galvanometer is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0024753_Question_xyz_-_Copy.jpg\" style=\"width: 161px; height: 144px;\" />",
    "image": null
